! The Orrery of High Delos

''Stratum:'' High Delos · ''Scale:'' Site — but its subject runs Reach-tier and beyond.

Canon: the Orrery holds ''Lares node maps showing where Elyncia's pattern has reached into
neighboring worlds to patch her own seams'' — records that align with Gaia's Vastlands archive:
void currents, rearranged constellations, wormhole lanes remembered only in song. The map of
maps; the instrument that knows where the worlds touch.

//The doctrine it serves: [[the-reachable-worlds|lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/concepts/the-reachable-worlds]] — the Orrery maps where the worlds touch, and therefore where the offcuts fall.//

''Open prompts:'' who reads it, and who may stand before it · whether the table ever does ·
whether it renders as the campaign's master-map artifact (the weld to the Node Interaction Card
and the Painter's establishing boards stands noted).

